        "original_id": "111b9842-70b8-565f-b850-8bd61e4e6cb4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fritz Tornow, Adolf Hitler, Eva Braun, Martin Bormann\n- Animals: Blondi, Blondi's puppies, Eva Braun's dogs, Tornow's dachshund\n\nFacts:\n- In 1941, Martin Bormann gave Blondi, a German Shepherd puppy, to Adolf Hitler.\n- Blondi lived from 1941 to 29 April 1945.\n- Fritz Tornow was responsible for caring for Adolf Hitler's German Shepherd Blondi and Blondi's puppies.\n- Fritz Tornow was also responsible for caring for Eva Braun's dogs.\n- Fritz Tornow had his own pet dachshund.",
